# DISCORD HELPER

![Discord Helper](discord_helper/gui/assets/logo-horizontal.png)

> **EXPERIMENTAL SOFTWARE** — 100% vibe-coded prototype. Use only for testing and experimentation.

A fully local Discord voice AI bot: Whisper for speech-to-text, Ollama for reasoning, HuggingFace TTS for voice replies. No cloud LLM APIs required.

---

## Quick Install

### Linux / macOS

```bash
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JoseISC/Discord-Helper/instalador/scripts/install.sh | bash
```

### Windows (PowerShell)

```powershell
iwr -useb https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JoseISC/Discord-Helper/instalador/scripts/install.ps1 | iex
```

### Advanced — with CUDA extras

```bash
pipx install "discord-helper[cuda] @ git+https://github.com/JoseISC/Discord-Helper@instalador"
```

---

## First Run

```bash
discord-helper setup      # configure bot token + models
discord-helper doctor     # verify all dependencies
discord-helper run        # start the bot
```

---

## GUI Dashboard

```bash
discord-helper gui
```

Opens a retro Windows XP-inspired local dashboard at `http://127.0.0.1:8750` showing runtime status, system checks, Ollama models, and live logs.

---

## Runtime Commands

```bash
discord-helper setup
discord-helper doctor
discord-helper run
discord-helper gui
discord-helper logs
discord-helper install-service    # systemd / launchd / Task Scheduler
discord-helper uninstall-service
discord-helper update
discord-helper version
```

---

## Discord Bot Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `/join` | Join your voice channel |
| `/leave` | Leave the voice channel |
| `/ask [seconds]` | Record, transcribe and answer in text |
| `/start` | Start continuous listening |
| `/stop` | Stop listening and reply with voice |
| `/chat <message>` | Text chat with the local LLM |
| `/clear` | Clear conversation history |

---

## Local AI Stack

- **STT:** `faster-whisper` (NVIDIA CTranslate2, CUDA or CPU)
- **LLM:** Ollama — any local model (llama3, mistral, gemma2...)
- **TTS:** HuggingFace `facebook/mms-tts-spa` (VITS)
- **Audio:** FFmpeg + discord.py voice

---

## Supported Platforms

| Platform | Installer | Service |
|----------|-----------|---------|
| Linux | `install.sh` (apt / dnf / pacman) | systemd --user |
| macOS | `install.sh` (Homebrew) | launchd |
| Windows | `install.ps1` (winget) | Task Scheduler |

